sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Channel
  participant S as Switch / policy
  participant C as Core
  participant B as Stand-in authority
  participant D as Device
  A->>S: Authorization request
  S->>C: Request online decision
  C--xS: Unavailable
  alt No approved stand-in policy: lab default
    S-->>A: UNAVAILABLE / deny
    Note over S,D: No dispense command
  else Issuer-approved bounded policy: outside lab
    S->>B: Check delegated budget and authority
    B-->>S: Bounded decision and reconciliation record
    Note over S,D: Device action requires that separate approved contract
  end
